# resources/manifest.json pins a byte count and a SHA-256 for every frozen
# resource, and benchmark-results/ filenames are content hashes. Any end-of-line
# translation changes those bytes: with the default core.autocrlf=true on
# Windows, a fresh clone checked out policies/luna-high-slot1-chessbench100-v1.json
# at 800 bytes instead of 776 and test_frozen_resource_hashes failed.
# Line-ending conversion is therefore disabled repository-wide. Do not narrow this.
* -text
